<DocsLayout
  title="History"
  description="Review sessions, compare runs, and inspect run-level details."
  prevPage={{ slug: "overview", title: "Overview" }}
  nextPage={{ slug: "benchmarks", title: "Benchmark Progress" }}
>
  <h2>What History Is For</h2>
  <p>
    History is where you review your practice in depth. Sessions group runs by
    time, and each session can be opened to inspect the runs, compare scores,
    and look at trends.
  </p>

  <h2>What You Can Do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Browse sessions in chronological order.</li>
    <li>Filter sessions and runs with search, sorting, and PB filters.</li>
    <li>
      Open run details to compare a primary run against another run or a
      personal best.
    </li>
    <li>
      Review the session overview to see summaries, radar charts, and trend
      widgets.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Useful Habits</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Check the latest session after every practice block.</li>
    <li>Use comparison mode when a score feels inconsistent.</li>
    <li>
      Look for patterns across a few sessions instead of overreacting to one
      run.
    </li>
  </ol>
</DocsLayout>
